# derivation-differential-mutants reads: the helper it mutates (copied with its whole reconcile directory, because the
# helper lifts functions out of apply.sh and preclassify.sh), the sibling driver derivation-differential/run.sh (re-executed
# against each copy; declared whole), the shared preamble that driver sources, and the real validator the helper runs on both
# sides. scripts/install.sh is the marker run.sh walks up for to find its root (distribution coordinates; it is not read).
# The driver also seeds the real scope classifier, the sprint-status reader it runs and that reader's schema into every
# distribution it builds, so the helper's join reads them; the driver announces them.
!core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/derivation-differential.sh
core/scripts/check-owed-derivations.sh
core/scripts/sprint-status.sh
core/schemas/sprint-status.json
core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/
core/fixtures/derivation-differential/
core/fixtures/lib/
core/scripts/validate-artifact-derivations.sh
scripts/install.sh
